    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_post_op_review_photo_flow_token_sakerhet",
      "label": "Token-s\u00e4kerhet f\u00f6r patientl\u00e4nk (hash, TTL, rate limit)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/post-op-review-photo-flow.md",
      "source_location": "\u00a72.3 S\u00e4kerhet + risk R2",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": "2026-05-18",
      "author": "DXM-pass",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Endast SHA-256-hashen lagras i storen medan klartext-token bara finns i URL:en; l\u00e4nken \u00e4r eng\u00e5ngs, bunden till bookingCaseId och TTL 90 dagar."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_post_op_review_photo_flow_publiceringssamtycke",
      "label": "Publiceringssamtycke default OFF + besk\u00e4rning \u00f6gonbryn och upp\u00e5t",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/post-op-review-photo-flow.md",
      "source_location": "\u00a77 punkt 3 + risk R5",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": "2026-05-18",
      "author": "DXM-pass",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Submission fungerar utan samtycke \u2014 kliniken f\u00e5r bilderna men f\u00e5r inte publicera dem, vilket ger klar separation och skyddar mot samtycke givet i affekt. Publicering kr\u00e4ver manuell besk\u00e4rning till en separat -public.webp."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_post_op_review_photo_flow_foto_retention",
      "label": "Fotoretention: 365 dagar utan samtycke, obegr\u00e4nsat med samtycke",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/post-op-review-photo-flow.md",
      "source_location": "\u00a77 punkt 3 + risk R3/R4",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": "2026-05-18",
      "author": "DXM-pass",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Metadata-raden beh\u00e5lls efter filradering (photosDeletedAt) f\u00f6r audit, medan GDPR-radering p\u00e5 beg\u00e4ran \u00e4r omedelbar och full oavsett samtyckesflagga."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_post_op_review_photo_flow_transactional_touch",
      "label": "Canon-tolkning: transactional touch, inte \u00f6ppnad patientkanal",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/post-op-review-photo-flow.md",
      "source_location": "\u00a77 punkt 1 (bekr\u00e4ftad 2026-05-18)",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": "2026-05-18",
      "author": "DXM-pass",
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Operator-initierat, ingen AI-genererad patienttext, statisk mall och statisk uppladdningssida \u2014 d\u00e4rf\u00f6r r\u00e4knas det inte som att patientkanalen \u00f6ppnats, men gateway, audit och risk-gating k\u00f6rs \u00e4nd\u00e5."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_post_op_review_photo_flow_exif_strip",
      "label": "EXIF-strip p\u00e5 patientuppladdade foton (PII-l\u00e4ckagerisk)",
